note [Time & Date Library Demonstration in E++ (.enppl)]
add the "Time" library

note [1. Reading Clock and Calendar]
say "Current system time:", the current time
say "Current system date:", the current date
say "Current calendar year:", the current year
say "Unix timestamp:", the current timestamp

note [2. Waiting and Sleeping]
say "Preparing countdown in 500 milliseconds..."
wait 500 milliseconds
say "Pausing for 1 second..."
wait 1 second
say "Resumed execution successfully!"
